event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":73,"item_id":"rs_0f1357940c5d9597016acc33a408308196a63bf21cf0b5273f","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Planning database migration**\n\nI'm thinking about whether I have enough time with my remaining tokens, which is about 8k. I need to focus on tests I can write that will use a similar fixture for the migration. My plan is to prepopulate the simplest new test with SQLite by importing the old schema. It's essential to keep things straightforward, especially during this database transition."}

